#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:233
msgid "Interface Changes"
msgstr "인터페이스 변경사항"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:235
msgid ""
"Some interfaces has been fixed. See :ref:`v430-interface-changes` for "
